**Step 3.** Terminal 2 — check whether a new file appeared:\n```bash\nls -la ~/.gemini/tmp/cledger-smoke/chats/\n```\n👉 Tell me if you see a **fourth** `.jsonl` file (a `06-xx` one). This is the key observation.\n\n**Step 4.** Terminal 1:\n```\n/rewind\n```\nHighlight **`what is 2+2?`**, press Enter, choose **\"Rewind conversation\"**.\n\n**Step 5.** Terminal 2 — same command again:\n```bash\nls -la ~/.gemini/tmp/cledger-smoke/chats/\n```\n👉 Is that fourth file **still there**?\n\n**Step 6.** Terminal 1:\n```\n/quit\n```\n\n**Step 7.** Terminal 2 — one last time:\n```bash\nls -la ~/.gemini/tmp/cledger-smoke/chats/\n```\n👉 Is it **still there**, or did it vanish?\n\n**Step 8.** Tell me what you saw at steps 3, 5, and 7. I'll read the hook log myself.\n\nIf `/rewind` errors or the dialog doesn't offer \"Rewind conversation\", stop and tell me — don't work around it.\n\nneeds input: the three `ls` results from steps 3, 5, and 7, plus one short Gemini session so the instrumented hook log has data.","type":"text"}],"role":"assistant"},"context":{"branch":"worktree-more-cli-adapters","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger/.claude/worktrees/more-cli-adapters","head":"e695d5b39679f4b4ab1948b4b4d336961ee6ffa6","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:d10310cd-8144-4046-87b9-97bbb6ace18c","seq":1180},"id":"ev1-a71f950846a71b41553efe782d81295ee0a1e21b05495a0a619c25e1694d9800","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-08-06T06:11:25.502Z","producer":{"model":"claude-opus-5","session_id":"d10310cd-8144-4046-87b9-97bbb6ace18c","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.223","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger/.claude/worktrees/more-cli-adapters","effort":"high","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"worktree-more-cli-adapters","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"Wrapper v2 is in place and verified — it now lo